OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 3 Dec to Sat 12 Dec
OL,6,FHigh pressure extends across the UK at
OL,7,Fthe start of this period, bringing
OL,8,Fsettled, dry conditions and spells of
OL,9,Fsunshine. Over the first weekend,
OL,10,FAtlantic frontal systems will begin to
OL,11,Fmove in from the northwest - how much
OL,12,Fprogress these make across the UK is
OL,13,Funcertain, but any heavy rainfall will
OL,14,Fprobably be restricted to parts of the
OL,15,Fnorthwest, with elsewhere drier. Later
OL,16,Fin this period, high pressure will
OL,17,Flikely dominate again, meaning a good
OL,18,Fdeal of dry weather, albeit with a
OL,19,Frisk of mist and fog in places.
OL,20,FTemperatures are expected to be near
OL,21,Fnormal or slightly below.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
