OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1795881333
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sun 13 Dec to Sun 27 Dec
OL,6,FHigh pressure will probably be
OL,7,Fdominant at the start of this period,
OL,8,Fmeaning settled, dry weather for many
OL,9,Fareas, albeit with a risk of mist and
OL,10,Ffog. Later in December, there is
OL,11,Flikely to be a greater influence from
OL,12,Ffrontal systems moving in from the
OL,13,Fwest, bringing some unsettled weather
OL,14,Fand spells of rain, as well as some
OL,15,Fsnow in the north. Temperatures will
OL,16,Fprobably be near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
